{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And go</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other two: גם צאנכם גם בקרכם קחו ולכו, ואור לכם ולכו. This teaches that he permitted them to take sheep and cattle even though they do not leave Egypt, and this is גם צאנכם גם בקרכם קחו ולכו. And he told them that they should not depart except בכי טוב, and this is ואור לכם ולכו."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:14.912862579Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}